  "_comment": "Workflows per workspace. `category` must match a slug in categories.json — seed categories first or publishing 400s. Loopride runs 4 workflows, Northwind 5: the counts and the triggers differ on purpose. Promotional sends are NOT workflows — they go out as a broadcast to the all-subscribers list (see lib/server/hub.ts), which is why `offers-and-promos` and `product-news` have no workflow here.",

